      "statusChangeID": "5d79f98d9db0175547fb2552",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Spine bending has been greatly improved. It is a bit of a balancing act-- if you tune it too much one way, you get X problem. Tune it too much the other, you get Y problem. A bit simplified, but that's what we're working with.\n\nWe'll continue looking at this.",
